### Login as admin
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login as user
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user",
  "password": "password123"
}

